    {
      "id": "p0097-b002",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Big game companies spend tons of money to make awesome, realistic-looking characters with spiffy designs and outfits… and then Toby comes along and makes a round rectangle with eyes",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.7264177,
          0.0907143,
          0.8960174,
          0.2321429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.7264177,
          0.0907143,
          0.8960174,
          0.2321429
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "大游戏公司花大钱塑造炫酷逼真的角色，精心设计造型和服装……然后 Toby 来了，画了个长着眼睛的圆角矩形。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.7315262,
          0.0914286,
          0.9011258,
          0.2378571
        ],
        "font_size": 15.5,
        "line_height": 1.4838709677419355,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "left"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
