          0.2378571
        ],
        "font_size": 15.5,
        "leading": 23.0
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0097-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Napstablook’s identity was also a concern for the localization staff. First, because the English script refers to Napstablook as “them” rather than “him” or “her”, the localization team kept Napstablook’s gender unstated and unclear as much as possible in the Japanese script.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0888866,
          0.2442857,
          0.7090491,
          0.3178571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0888866,
          0.2442857,
          0.7090491,
          0.3178571
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "本地化团队也很在意 Napstablook 的身份。首先，英文台词用 them（此处不指明性别），而不用 him（他）或 her（她），因此日文也尽量不说明或暗示其性别。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0919516,
          0.2421429,
          0.7059841,
          0.3221429
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0919516,
          0.2421429,
          0.7059841,
          0.3221429
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0097-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Secondly, Napstablook is referred to as a “ghost” in English, but there are many words for “ghost” in Japanese. Unfortunately, these words have their own unique nuances and definitions, none of which are a 100% match with the Western-style “sheet ghost”. As a result, Napstablook’s ghost classification changed throughout Undertale’s localization. These classifications included:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0878649,
          0.3264286,
          0.7090491,
          0.4185714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0878649,
          0.3264286,
          0.7090491,
          0.4185714
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "其次，英文称 Napstablook 为 ghost（幽灵），但日语中有许多表示“幽灵”的词。遗憾的是，这些词各有细微差别和定义，没有一个能与西方式的“床单幽灵”完全对应。因此，在 Undertale 的本地化过程中，对 Napstablook 的分类曾多次变更，考虑过的词包括：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 91,
            "end": 100,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0919516,
          0.3242857,
          0.7059841,
          0.4235714
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
