    {
      "id": "p0097-b010",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "I remember when they had to explain the meaning of “:)” in movies, so it’s been fascinating to see other online speech patterns – such as using all-lowercase text – show up more and more in popular media",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.7264177,
          0.575,
          0.9011258,
          0.7164286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.7264177,
          0.575,
          0.9011258,
          0.7164286
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "我还记得电影里需要解释“:)”含义的年代。如今，其他网络说话方式——比如全小写文字——越来越多地出现在大众媒体中，实在很有意思。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.7315262,
          0.575,
          0.9031692,
          0.725
        ],
        "font_size": 15.5,
        "line_height": 1.4838709677419355,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "left"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.7315262,
          0.575,
          0.9031692,
          0.725
        ],
        "font_size": 15.5,
        "leading": 23.0
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0097-b011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Napstablook is insecure and has little self-worth, which is partially conveyed by a unique speech style: all of their text is written with lowercase characters. This not only supplements Napstablook’s dialogue, but also allows the player to identify anonymous messages from Napstablook elsewhere in the game.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0878649,
          0.7285714,
          0.7100708,
          0.8035714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0878649,
          0.7285714,
          0.7100708,
          0.8035714
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Napstablook 缺乏安全感，也没什么自我价值感。一种独特的说话方式部分传达了这种性格：全部台词都用小写字母。这不仅补充了对话的表达，也让玩家能认出游戏其他地方来自 Napstablook 的匿名消息。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.09297329805147944,
          0.7264285714285714,
          0.7070057390288327,
          0.8114285714285714
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.09297329805147944,
          0.7264285714285714,
          0.7070057390288327,
          0.8114285714285714
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0097-b012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because the Japanese language doesn’t have uppercase and lowercase letters, the translator compensated by giving Napstablook an “I’m worthless, what does anything matter” tone, along with a speaking style that mixes hiragana and katakana in an unusual manner. In this way, the Japanese version of Napstablook parallels the English version in style and substance.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0888866,
          0.8121429,
          0.7100708,
          0.905
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0888866,
          0.8121429,
          0.7100708,
          0.905
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "日语没有字母的大小写之分，译者便给 Napstablook 安排了“我一无是处，一切又有什么意义”的口吻，同时以不同寻常的方式混用平假名和片假名。这样，日版 Napstablook 在说话风格和内在性格上，都与英文版形成了对应。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.09297329805147944,
          0.8185714285714286,
          0.7070057390288327,
          0.9142857142857143
